00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:41.803
to finally tell him what he meant to me.

00:05:41.803 --> 00:05:43.710
- Oh, that's so cool.
- Yep.

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:45.210
- Yeah, you like to tell people that.

00:05:45.210 --> 00:05:46.503
I like that about you so far in this.

00:05:46.503 --> 00:05:48.120
That you like to let people know

00:05:48.120 --> 00:05:50.010
that they like made a change
and an impact in your life.

00:05:50.010 --> 00:05:50.843
That's cool.

00:05:50.843 --> 00:05:51.870
- I was telling you that on the way out.

00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:54.570
- Well, nobody, not
everybody does that. Yeah.

00:05:54.570 --> 00:05:56.520
