00:05:56.520 --> 00:05:57.353
I don't know.

00:05:57.353 --> 00:05:58.186
Maybe they feel foolish or whatever-

00:05:58.186 --> 00:05:59.130
- [Mark] You do that all the time.

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:02.220
- I do. Well, I'm a very
chatty person in general,

00:06:02.220 --> 00:06:03.844
