big impact on me. Yeah.

00:06:13.110 --> 00:06:14.520
What about "NCIS"?

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:16.740
Like, this show is ingrained in us.

00:06:16.740 --> 00:06:18.990
It was in my household
for so long, like...

00:06:18.990 --> 00:06:20.187
- Mine too.
- I know.

00:06:20.187 --> 00:06:21.020
(audience laughing)

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:23.850
