saying goodbye to that,

00:06:23.850 --> 00:06:28.140
it's been a couple years
now, so what do you feel now?

00:06:28.140 --> 00:06:29.383
Do you miss it?

00:06:29.383 --> 00:06:32.700
- I think for the longest
time I was just tired.

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:34.620
- It's long hours.
- Oh, yeah.

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:35.610
- Yeah.

00:06:35.610 --> 00:06:37.320
- Originally part of it, taking the job,

00:06:37.320 --> 00:06:40.170
being home for a young
family, not traveling as much,

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:41.470
doing movies and whatever.

00:06:42.527 --> 00:06:46.860
The first day we worked
22 hours, so I thought,

00:06:46.860 --> 00:06:49.290
that's not exactly what I
thought this was gonna be,

00:06:49.290 --> 00:06:51.180
but there were, we had
a lot of days like that

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:52.555
in the first four years.

00:06:52.555 --> 00:06:53.419
- Oh, yikes.

00:06:53.419 --> 00:06:56.670
- So, that it's been the success
it's become, that's great.

00:06:56.670 --> 00:06:58.363
To be part of that is great.

00:06:58.363 --> 00:07:02.220
You know, writers change,
runners change, casts change,

00:07:02.220 --> 00:07:05.280
all that and I always tried
to pay attention to that

00:07:05.280 --> 00:07:10.280
and daily tried to do what
my title said, which is,

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:12.420
you know, read ahead and note ahead

00:07:12.420 --> 00:07:13.975
and do all those kind of things.

00:07:13.975 --> 00:07:16.650
And it's a lot, you know?

00:07:16.650 --> 00:07:19.290
And again, I paid attention
in the writing room, so.

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:21.179
- Yeah, which is important.
That's the story.

00:07:21.179 --> 00:07:24.630
- Yeah, and that that was
successful, I'm proud of,

00:07:24.630 --> 00:07:26.760
and the people who are part of that.

00:07:26.760 --> 00:07:28.080
It's how I met Leon Carroll

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:30.063
who I ended up writing the book with,

00:07:31.320 --> 00:07:33.900
and I wouldn't trade that
relationship with anyone.

00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:36.990
So I'm proud of it in a different way.

00:07:36.990 --> 00:07:39.240
- I love that this relationship
carried over with Leon

00:07:39.240 --> 00:07:42.630
as well because you ended
up co-authoring this book.

00:07:42.630 --> 00:07:43.497
- I did.

00:07:43.497 --> 00:07:45.035
- And you worked with him on NCIS?

00:07:45.035 --> 00:07:45.868
- I did.

00:07:45.868 --> 00:07:47.130
- He's a really gen, right?

00:07:47.130 --> 00:07:48.603
- And in the be beginning, Kelly,

00:07:48.603 --> 00:07:52.899
I tried to look up NCIS.
I'd never heard of it.

00:07:52.899 --> 00:07:54.570
- I'd never heard of it before your show.

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:57.000
- Okay, you know about
it because of the show.

00:07:57.000 --> 00:07:57.833
- [Kelly] Yes.

00:07:57.833 --> 00:08:00.390
- But it had been around for
a long time. Long, long time.

00:08:00.390 --> 00:08:01.802
- Yeah.
- Okay?

00:08:01.802 --> 00:08:02.790
And, and the reason you
didn't know about it

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:05.400
