if no one knows about it.

00:08:10.710 --> 00:08:12.123
That's really why, okay?

00:08:12.123 --> 00:08:12.956
- Oh, wow.

00:08:12.956 --> 00:08:13.980
- So then there's a TV show

00:08:13.980 --> 00:08:16.470
and I'm trying to figure
out how to play a character,

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:18.150
