00:08:20.490 --> 00:08:23.370
And I meet Leon Carroll and he's my guy.

00:08:23.370 --> 00:08:24.390
I mean, he's the real deal.

00:08:24.390 --> 00:08:28.020
He's a real special agent, okay?

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:29.670
I'm an actor.
- Yeah.

00:08:29.670 --> 00:08:31.097
- Big difference.

00:08:31.097 --> 00:08:31.930
(audience laughing)

00:08:31.930 --> 00:08:32.763
Big difference.

00:08:32.763 --> 00:08:37.710
But over the years, there was
ever never an interrogation

00:08:37.710 --> 00:08:39.120
on that show that I ever did

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:40.890
without talking to him first

00:08:40.890 --> 00:08:43.140
and asking him about how he would do it.

00:08:43.140 --> 00:08:44.970
What's the right way to do that?

00:08:44.970 --> 00:08:47.580
You know, how to put
on a pair of handcuffs.

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:48.660
Whatever it was,

00:08:48.660 --> 00:08:51.640
there were a thousand
things I had a day with him.

00:08:51.640 --> 00:08:53.885
- Yeah, to get it right.
- But in over 20 years,

00:08:53.885 --> 00:08:55.860
over 19 years, we developed a bond

00:08:55.860 --> 00:09:00.360
